  [CONNECTOR:68:HDMI-A-1] HDMI: latency present 0 0, video latency 0 0, audio latency 0 0
  [CONNECTOR:68:HDMI-A-1] ELD size 36, SAD count 1
  [CONNECTOR:68:HDMI-A-1] Same epoch counter 10
 
